  "published": "2025-11-24T06:36:40.503Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of ND Observability Framework for .NET 6.0 applications.\n\t\t\tProvides unified logging, tracing, and metrics instrumentation.\n\t\t\tAdds INDLoggerService for structured logging with enriched metadata.\n\t\t\tIncludes Request Metrics Middleware (request count, latency, inflight, errors).\n\t\t\tSupports INDMetricService for custom application metrics.\n\t\t\tEnables distributed tracing with automatic span creation correlation propagation.\n\t\t\tOffers configuration-based control to enable/disable logs, metrics, and traces.\n\t\t\tIncludes OpenTelemetry exporters for Console and OTLP endpoints.\n\t\t\tDesigned for easy integration into .NET 6 microservices.",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "ND Observability Framework for .NET 6",
